# Walkthrough - TCG Storefront Modernization (Phase 2)

I have successfully completed the premium UI overhaul for all remaining TCG categories—**Magic: The Gathering**, **Disney Lorcana**, and **One Piece TCG**—while implementing a global "Stable Navigation" system to prevent layout shifts.

## 🏗️ Core Structural Changes

### Stable Breadcrumb Navigation
To solve the "ugly jumping" issue when browsing between different categories and sets, I have decoupled the navigation breadcrumbs from the dynamic hero banners.

- **Fixed Location**: Breadcrumbs now live in a dedicated `.store-breadcrumb` container at the top of the content area.
- **Perfect Alignment**: Whether you are on a category index or a specific set, the `Store / TCG / Set` links stay in the exact same position, providing a smooth, high-end browsing experience.

